<!DOCTYPE html>
<!--
============================================================================
🧭 BAQUEANO ECOSYSTEM — PORTAL OFICIAL & ECOSISTEMA WEB (index.html)
============================================================================

🎯 1. POR QUÉ (WHY / PROPÓSITO):
- Servir como la puerta de entrada oficial y portal de presentación del ecosistema
  tecnológico de Baqueano Nicaragua.
- Comunicar la misión fundacional: «Baqueano no existe para llevar más turistas
  a los mismos lugares. Existe para transformar el turismo en una actividad más
  responsable, distribuida, segura, culturalmente consciente y beneficiosa para las
  comunidades locales.»
- Demostrar los 5 impactos fundamentales del proyecto y permitir la descarga
  directa del APK oficial de la aplicación móvil para Android.
- Conectar de forma ordenada y modular a todas las páginas de experiencia especializada:
  Historia, Campaña Ambiental, Gastronomía Ancestral, Patrimonio Sonoro, Cooperativas 3D,
  Catálogo de Destinos y Baqueano Ops Center.

⚙️ 2. CÓMO (HOW / ARQUITECTURA & IMPLEMENTACIÓN):
- Arquitectura multi-página desacoplada con CSS modular en css/ y controladores en js/.
- Hero section cinematográfico con simulador de smartphone de la app Android.
- Showcase interactivo de los 5 impactos y vitrina de módulos especializados.
- Modales de Auxilio SOS 24/7 con GPS satelital e instalación de APK.

📦 3. QUÉ (WHAT / COMPONENTES EXPUESTOS):
- Hero Section & Smartphone Simulator.
- Los 5 Impactos del Proyecto Baqueano.
- Navegación hacia las 7 Páginas de Experiencia Especializada.
- Información oficial de la aplicación Android.
- Footer Institucional con Contactos de Emergencia Nacional.
============================================================================
-->
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <!-- ======================================================================
       SEO PRIMARIO — Metadatos Esenciales
       ====================================================================== -->
  <title>Baqueano Nicaragua | Ecoturismo Sostenible Sin Intermediarios</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Plataforma tecnológica oficial para ecoturismo sostenible, conservación comunitaria y soberanía campesina en Nicaragua. Descubre destinos auténticos, apoya cooperativas locales y descarga la app BaqueanoNicaragua para Android.">
  <meta name="keywords" content="ecoturismo Nicaragua, turismo sostenible, cooperativas campesinas, turismo comunitario, Baqueano Nicaragua, Cañón de Somoto, Isla de Ometepe, Cerro Negro, turismo responsable Nicaragua">
  <meta name="author" content="Baqueano Nicaragua — Ecosistema Digital de Ecoturismo">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#165D6F">

  <!-- URL Canonical — Producción Firebase Hosting -->
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://app-baqueano.web.app/">

  <!-- ======================================================================
       OPEN GRAPH (Facebook, WhatsApp, LinkedIn)
       ====================================================================== -->
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://app-baqueano.web.app/">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Baqueano Nicaragua | Ecoturismo Sin Intermediarios">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Descubre Nicaragua auténtica. Destinos protegidos, cooperativas campesinas, senderos con GPS y app Android gratuita. Sin comisiones, 100% para las comunidades.">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://app-baqueano.web.app/assets/images/og-image.jpg">
  <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
  <meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
  <meta property="og:image:alt" content="Baqueano Nicaragua — Ecoturismo Sostenible en Tierras Campesinas">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="Baqueano Nicaragua">
  <meta property="og:locale" content="es_NI">

  <!-- ======================================================================
       TWITTER CARDS
       ====================================================================== -->
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Baqueano Nicaragua | Ecoturismo Sin Intermediarios">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Plataforma tecnológica para turismo sostenible y soberanía campesina en Nicaragua.">
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://app-baqueano.web.app/assets/images/og-image.jpg">

  <!-- ======================================================================
       STRUCTURED DATA — JSON-LD (WebSite + Organization + MobileApp)
       ====================================================================== -->
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [
      {
        "@type": "WebSite",
        "@id": "https://app-baqueano.web.app/#website",
        "url": "https://app-baqueano.web.app/",
        "name": "Baqueano Nicaragua",
        "description": "Plataforma tecnológica oficial para turismo sostenible, conservación comunitaria y soberanía campesina en Nicaragua.",
        "inLanguage": "es",
        "potentialAction": {
          "@type": "SearchAction",
          "target": "https://app-baqueano.web.app/destinos.html?q={search_term_string}",
          "query-input": "required name=search_term_string"
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "@id": "https://app-baqueano.web.app/#organization",
        "name": "Baqueano Nicaragua",
        "url": "https://app-baqueano.web.app/",
        "logo": "https://app-baqueano.web.app/assets/images/logo.png",
        "description": "Ecosistema digital de ecoturismo sostenible para cooperativas campesinas de Nicaragua.",
        "areaServed": {
          "@type": "Country",
          "name": "Nicaragua"
        },
        "contactPoint": {
          "@type": "ContactPoint",
          "contactType": "customer support",
          "availableLanguage": "Spanish",
          "contactOption": "TollFree"
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "MobileApplication",
        "name": "Baqueano Nicaragua",
        "operatingSystem": "Android",
        "applicationCategory": "TravelApplication",
        "offers": {
          "@type": "Offer",
          "price": "0",
          "priceCurrency": "USD"
        },
        "description": "Aplicación Android con mapas offline, GPS en sendero, Baqueano AI y sistema SOS 24/7 para exploradores en Nicaragua."
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <!-- ======================================================================
       ÍCONOS Y PWA MANIFEST
       ====================================================================== -->
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="assets/images/logo.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="assets/images/logo.png">
  <link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">

  <!-- Tipografías Oficiales Google Fonts -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;700;800;900&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">

  <!-- Leaflet Map CSS -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/leaflet/1.9.4/leaflet.min.css">

  <!-- Estilos Maestros Oficiales (Modular) -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/modules.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/videos.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/theme-switcher.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/nicaragua-branding.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/baqueano-reels.css">

  <!-- ======================================================================
       ESTILOS DEL MÓDULO DE REGISTRO DE NEGOCIOS & ANFITRIONES
       🎯 Por qué: Estética de alta gama, glassmorphism y adaptabilidad móvil total
          para la captación de cooperativas, hospedajes y comedores campesinos.
       ⚙️ Cómo: Rejilla CSS Grid responsiva, tokens oficiales (#165D6F, #F65E01,
          #F4E6C1, #0F172A), microinteracciones y dropzone interactivo.
       📦 Qué: Clases .register-biz-section, .biz-form-grid, .biz-btn-submit, etc.
       ====================================================================== -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/pages/index.css">

  <!-- ======================================================================
       ESTILOS DEL MAPA VIVO 3D, DISEÑADOR DE RUTAS Y ASISTENTE BAQUEANO
       🎯 Por qué: Proporcionar la experiencia 3D central insignia de Nicaragua
          con controles WebGL, HUD, visor 360° y tarjetas dinámicas tilt.
       ⚙️ Cómo: Tokens oficiales (#165D6F, #F65E01, #F4E6C1, #0F172A),
          aceleración por GPU, microinteracciones a 60fps y adaptabilidad móvil.
       📦 Qué: Clases .mapa-vivo-3d-section, .route-builder-section, etc.
       ====================================================================== -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/baqueano-3d.css">

  <!-- ======================================================================
       🗺️ ESTILOS MAPA REAL DE NICARAGUA — PINES, POPUPS Y CONTENEDOR LEAFLET
       🎯 Por qué: Personalizar la apariencia de Leaflet para que sea coherente
          con la identidad visual de Baqueano (#165D6F, #F65E01, #0F172A).
       ⚙️ Cómo: Clases .baqueano-map-pin, .baqueano-popup-wrap, .baq-map-popup
          aplicadas a los marcadores SVG y popups enriquecidos del mapa real.
       📦 Qué: Estilos de pines SVG, animación de pulso, popup con imagen y CTA.
       ====================================================================== -->
  <style>
    /* ── Contenedor del mapa Leaflet integrado en el HUD ── */
    #baqueano3dCanvasWrap {
      width: 100%;
      height: 520px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #0F172A;
      position: relative;
    }
    #baqueano3dCanvasWrap .leaflet-container {
      background: #080D1A !important;
      font-family: 'Inter', 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      border-radius: 14px;
    }

    /* ── Pines personalizados ── */
    .baqueano-map-pin {
      background: transparent !important;
      border: none !important;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
      filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 12px rgba(22, 93, 111, 0.5));
    }
    .baqueano-map-pin:hover {
      filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 18px rgba(246, 94, 1, 0.7));
      z-index: 9999 !important;
    }

    /* ── Anillo de pulso SVG (animación continua) ── */
    @keyframes pinPulse {
      0%   { r: 19; opacity: 0.5; }
      50%  { r: 22; opacity: 0.2; }
      100% { r: 19; opacity: 0.5; }
    }
    .baqueano-map-pin .pin-pulse-ring {
      animation: pinPulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    /* ── Popup contenedor ── */
    .baqueano-popup-wrap .leaflet-popup-content-wrapper {
      background: #0F172A;
      border: 1px solid rgba(22, 93, 111, 0.5);
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 0 1px rgba(246, 94, 1, 0.15);
      padding: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      min-width: 320px;
      max-width: 360px;
    }
    .baqueano-popup-wrap .leaflet-popup-content {
      margin: 0;
      width: 100% !important;
    }
    .baqueano-popup-wrap .leaflet-popup-tip {
      background: #0F172A;
    }
    .baqueano-popup-wrap .leaflet-popup-close-button {
      color: #F4E6C1 !important;
      font-size: 18px !important;
      padding: 6px 10px !important;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    /* ── Tarjetas (Cards) Centradas en el Visor del Mapa Real y Mapa Territorial ── */
    #baqueano3dCanvasWrap .leaflet-popup.baq-popup-centered,
    #indexTerritoryMap .leaflet-popup.baq-popup-centered {
      position: absolute !important;
      top: 50% !important;
      left: 50% !important;
      bottom: auto !important;
      right: auto !important;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) !important;
      margin: 0 !important;
      z-index: 2000 !important;
      pointer-events: auto !important;
      width: calc(100% - 32px) !important;
      max-width: 360px !important;
      animation: baqPopupCenterPop 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
    }
    #baqueano3dCanvasWrap .leaflet-popup.baq-popup-centered .leaflet-popup-tip-container,
    #indexTerritoryMap .leaflet-popup.baq-popup-centered .leaflet-popup-tip-container {
      display: none !important;
    }
    @keyframes baqPopupCenterPop {
      0% {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translate(-50%, -46%) scale(0.94);
      }
      100% {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1);
      }
    }

    /* ── Popup interior ── */
    .baq-map-popup { color: #F4E6C1; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }

    .baq-popup-header {
      padding: 12px 14px 10px;
      border-radius: 0;
    }
    .baq-popup-cat-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .baq-popup-title {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #F4E6C1;
      margin: 0 0 2px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .baq-popup-tagline {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: rgba(244,230,193,0.65);
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    /* ── Imagen del popup ── */
    .baq-popup-img-wrap {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      height: 90px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .baq-popup-img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }
    .baq-map-popup:hover .baq-popup-img { transform: scale(1.06); }

    .baq-popup-img-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(15,23,42,0.9), transparent);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }
    .baq-popup-coops {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #F65E01;
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.8);
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(246,94,1,0.4);
    }

    /* ── Descripción y highlights ── */
    .baq-popup-desc {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: rgba(244,230,193,0.8);
      padding: 8px 12px 4px;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .baq-popup-highlights {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0 12px 6px;
      margin: 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2px 4px;
    }
    .baq-popup-highlights li {
      font-size: 10.5px;
      color: rgba(244,230,193,0.7);
      padding: 2px 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    /* ── CTA del popup ── */
    .baq-popup-cta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 6px;
      margin: 4px 12px 10px;
      padding: 7px 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F65E01, #e04d00);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(246,94,1,0.4);
    }
    .baq-popup-cta:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6d1a, #F65E01);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(246,94,1,0.6);
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* ── Controles de zoom de Leaflet con estilo Baqueano ── */
    #baqueano3dCanvasWrap .leaflet-control-zoom {
      border: 1px solid rgba(22, 93, 111, 0.6) !important;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.5) !important;
      border-radius: 10px !important;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    #baqueano3dCanvasWrap .leaflet-control-zoom-in,
    #baqueano3dCanvasWrap .leaflet-control-zoom-out {
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.9) !important;
      color: #F4E6C1 !important;
      border: none !important;
      font-size: 16px !important;
    }
    #baqueano3dCanvasWrap .leaflet-control-zoom-in:hover,
    #baqueano3dCanvasWrap .leaflet-control-zoom-out:hover {
      background: rgba(22,93,111,0.8) !important;
      color: #F65E01 !important;
    }
    #baqueano3dCanvasWrap .leaflet-control-attribution {
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.75) !important;
      color: rgba(244,230,193,0.4) !important;
      font-size: 9px !important;
    }
    #baqueano3dCanvasWrap .leaflet-control-attribution a {
      color: rgba(22,93,111,0.8) !important;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <!-- ============================================================================
       🧭 BAQUEANO — BARRA DE NAVEGACIÓN INSTITUCIONAL ULTRA HD
       🎯 Por qué: Crear una primera impresión visual de altísima gama que refleje
          la identidad de Baqueano como plataforma líder de ecoturismo en Nicaragua.
       ⚙️ Cómo: Glassmorphism multicapa, glow ambiental reactivo al cursor,
          mega-dropdown cinematográfico, indicator pill animado con física de resorte,
          y botón de perfil con avatar. Totalmente responsivo con drawer móvil de alta gama.
       📦 Qué: Navbar fija con brand holográfico, menú pill, mega-dropdown "Mi País",
          botón Perfil, botón SOS 24/7 y hamburguesa animada.
       ============================================================================ -->
  <nav class="main-navbar" id="mainNavbar" role="navigation" aria-label="Navegación principal">
    <!-- Capa de luz ambiental dinámica (cursor tracking) -->
    <div class="nav-ambient-glow" id="navAmbientGlow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <!-- Filamento de luz inferior animado -->
    <div class="nav-bottom-light" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="container nav-inner">

      <!-- ═══════════ BRAND / LOGO ═══════════ -->
      <a href="index.html" class="brand-box" id="brandLogo" aria-label="Baqueano Nicaragua — Inicio">
        <!-- Halo holográfico detrás del logo -->
        <span class="brand-logo-halo" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <img src="assets/images/logo.png" alt="Baqueano Nicaragua" class="brand-logo-img" width="44" height="44">
        <div class="brand-text">
          <span class="brand-title">BAQUEANO</span>
          <span class="brand-tagline">NICARAGUA</span>
        </div>
        <!-- Barra de sub-acento animada -->
        <span class="brand-accent-bar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </a>

      <!-- ═══════════ MENÚ DE NAVEGACIÓN PRINCIPAL ═══════════ -->
      <div class="nav-links-menu" id="navLinksMenu" role="menubar">
        <!-- Píldora indicadora deslizante -->
        <span class="nav-pill-indicator" id="navPillIndicator" aria-hidden="true"></span>

        <!-- EXPLORAR — MEGA DROPDOWN TURÍSTICO -->
        <div class="nav-dropdown" id="navDropdownMiPais" role="none">
          <button class="nav-dropdown-trigger" type="button"
                  aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true"
                  aria-controls="megaMenuMiPais" id="triggerMiPais"
                  role="menuitem">
            <span class="nav-item-content">
              <span class="nav-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-compass nav-icon"></i></span>
              <span class="nav-text-group">
                <span class="nav-label">Explorar</span>
              </span>
            </span>
            <span class="nav-dropdown-caret"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
          </button>

          <!-- Mega-menu de Exploración de Nicaragua -->
          <div class="nav-dropdown-menu nav-mega-menu" id="megaMenuMiPais" role="menu" aria-labelledby="triggerMiPais">
            <div class="mega-menu-header" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="mega-menu-header-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-earth-americas"></i></span>
              <span class="mega-menu-header-title">Explora Nicaragua</span>
              <span class="mega-menu-header-line"></span>
            </div>

            <!-- Items del mega-menu organizados -->
            <a href="destinos.html" class="nav-dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
              <span class="nav-dd-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-map-location-dot"></i></span>
              <div class="nav-dd-text">
                <span class="nav-dd-title">Destinos &amp; Volcanes</span>
                <span class="nav-dd-desc">29 Áreas Protegidas, Playas y Lagos</span>
              </div>
              <span class="nav-dd-badge">29</span>
            </a>
            <a href="#experienciasNicaragua" class="nav-dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
              <span class="nav-dd-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-person-hiking"></i></span>
              <div class="nav-dd-text">
                <span class="nav-dd-title">Experiencias</span>
                <span class="nav-dd-desc">Senderismo, Surf, Sandboarding y Kayak</span>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="#territorioMapaSection" class="nav-dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
              <span class="nav-dd-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i></span>
              <div class="nav-dd-text">
                <span class="nav-dd-title">17 Territorios</span>
                <span class="nav-dd-desc">15 Departamentos · 2 Regiones Autónomas</span>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="historia.html" class="nav-dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
              <span class="nav-dd-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-scroll"></i></span>
              <div class="nav-dd-text">
                <span class="nav-dd-title">Historia</span>
                <span class="nav-dd-desc">Línea de Tiempo Patria y Raíces</span>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="gastronomia.html" class="nav-dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
              <span class="nav-dd-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-bowl-food"></i></span>
              <div class="nav-dd-text">
                <span class="nav-dd-title">Gastronomía</span>
                <span class="nav-dd-desc">Sazón Campesino y Comida Ancestral</span>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="musica.html" class="nav-dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
              <span class="nav-dd-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-guitar"></i></span>
              <div class="nav-dd-text">
                <span class="nav-dd-title">Música</span>
                <span class="nav-dd-desc">Patrimonio Sonoro y Marimba</span>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="ambiental.html" class="nav-dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
              <span class="nav-dd-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-leaf"></i></span>
              <div class="nav-dd-text">
                <span class="nav-dd-title">Ambiental</span>
                <span class="nav-dd-desc">Custodia Territorial &amp; Decálogo Verde</span>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="aliados.html" class="nav-dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
              <span class="nav-dd-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake-angle"></i></span>
              <div class="nav-dd-text">
                <span class="nav-dd-title">Aliados</span>
                <span class="nav-dd-desc">Cooperativas y Comunidades Campesinas</span>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="nosotros.html" class="nav-dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
              <span class="nav-dd-icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-people-roof"></i></span>
              <div class="nav-dd-text">
                <span class="nav-dd-title">Nosotros</span>
